e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CbJ_jfAjC_EQ7kNvwFFKagq&_nc_oc=AdqDrRidPWQZy1gdRHZl0B0NCU2vygZYrIg9JaLTU3--t3Aobaq_mNzeipEd0XA3GaY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBxR1pZxp5KkuEm3RvBwTkifO0R5a0nGntrKTrv2gtKoQ&oe=6A60A4B9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ebt4qS2Ak88Q7kNvwE1EZiW&_nc_oc=AdryxxRAMGrKw02dSTg6gAmEPXU5UxFg5deQa76tdhhBERs1n5bUjHdjM5ROFZhN6iI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAM8rtjOzObgy4eAHk9D_wpcPvZGMJxXc6dxLY62wlKxw&oe=6A60B453"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IiLok3_hLfIQ7kNvwGgDo6h&_nc_oc=AdpQP-PZGXscXIUg9kIsVcjew7uG4yzGan7Ze-P1ZX8nGcOj8DVtVhe834N7YvVPs3Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCpaCqvc5dNSIRzupx3nhGWmURtoEFNNNBRPN5Jlp_f8w&oe=6A60BFFB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QkdjFxbcIeEQ7kNvwGaV2mX&_nc_oc=AdoqwurjhIaKg5bGH3s_qADQc8L7V1RcdxXW_lcFd7S-Ir1oOTBnrK-ppDPb2M6mFOw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAAGopllWsqpG6bW6YoRmJmoFgWNhNiJznO6pUiQetq4g&oe=6A60C14A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3QZ2BbjS6K4Q7kNvwFGMk1T&_nc_oc=AdpOugwwp9NRf-MCiRHqw2irDKqNoyXVM99CaSjO7U6aOrp-_DkX11Yu0nonqYkTQcc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDgERr8flhguBbdoODpfsLQ6x1yKWMyV346mfns-icNtQ&oe=6A60AA7E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se